   "सूत्र ${}_a\\mu_g=\\frac cv$ से",
   "$\\frac43=\\frac{3\\times10^8}v$",
   "या $v=\\frac{9\\times10^8}4$",
   "**$=2.25\\times10^8$ मीटर/सेकण्ड**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "sec",
  "text": "पेज संख्या 576"
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "4",
  "lines": [
