   "$\\frac{I_{max}}{I_{min}}=\\frac{(\\sqrt{I_1}+\\sqrt{I_2})^2}{(\\sqrt{I_1}-\\sqrt{I_2})^2}$",
   "$=\\frac{(\\sqrt1+\\sqrt9)^2}{(\\sqrt1-\\sqrt9)^2}$",
   "$=\\frac{(1+3)^2}{(1-3)^2}$",
